@base = http://127.0.0.1:8092/api/tcc
@run = manual-001
# 每轮实验更换以下业务号；同一次实验的 confirm/cancel/retry 复用原编号。

### 1. 只 Try：观察 PREPARED / PENDING，以及库存、余额冻结
POST {{base}}/orders?prepareOnly=true
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"tcc-{{run}}-prepare","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":5.00,"failAt":"NONE"}

### 2. 查看两库业务资源、分支日志、订单和工作流
GET {{base}}/state

### 3. 手动 Confirm：SUCCEEDED / PAID；重复调用不重复消耗
POST {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-prepare/confirm

### 4. 查看当前工作流
GET {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-prepare

### 5. Confirm 后禁止改为 Cancel，预期 HTTP 409
POST {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-prepare/cancel

### 6. 独立的取消实验：先冻结
POST {{base}}/orders?prepareOnly=true
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"tcc-{{run}}-cancel","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":5.00,"failAt":"NONE"}

### 7. 手动 Cancel：释放冻结，CANCELLED / CANCELLED
POST {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-cancel/cancel

### 8. Try 库存之后业务失败；响应 HTTP 200，检查 status 及最终释放
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"tcc-{{run}}-failure","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":5.00,"failAt":"AFTER_STOCK"}

### 9. 二阶段故障实验：先冻结，须在默认 60 秒到期前确认
POST {{base}}/orders?prepareOnly=true
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"tcc-{{run}}-retry","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":5.00,"failAt":"NONE"}

### 10. Confirm 调用前失败一次、提交后丢失 ACK 一次
POST {{base}}/faults?phase=confirm&failNext=1&loseAckNext=1

### 11. 持久化 COMMIT 决议并推进；失败也不能切换 Cancel
POST {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-retry/confirm

### 12. 自动恢复后应 SUCCEEDED；ACK 丢失不重复消耗
GET {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-retry

### 13. 清除 Confirm 故障
POST {{base}}/faults?phase=confirm&failNext=0&loseAckNext=0

### 14. 原阶段人工重试（重试耗尽 blocked 后也使用此入口）
POST {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-retry/retry

### 15. 独立的 Cancel 故障实验：先冻结
POST {{base}}/orders?prepareOnly=true
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"tcc-{{run}}-cancel-retry","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":5.00,"failAt":"NONE"}

### 16. Cancel 调用前失败一次、提交后丢失 ACK 一次
POST {{base}}/faults?phase=cancel&failNext=1&loseAckNext=1

### 17. 取消并等待自动恢复；同一资源不能重复释放
POST {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-cancel-retry/cancel

### 18. 查看最终 CANCELLED 及 reserved=0
GET {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-cancel-retry

### 19. 清除剩余 Cancel 故障，避免影响下一轮实验
POST {{base}}/faults?phase=cancel&failNext=0&loseAckNext=0

### 20. 如已耗尽重试，人工继续 Cancel
POST {{base}}/orders/tcc-{{run}}-cancel-retry/retry
